[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.32}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 5.5600000000000005, "end": 6.24}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you part four of our romantic series called I'm Sorry I Love You.", "start": 6.58, "end": 11.86}, {"text": "Yeah, and today we've got some drama, don't we?", "start": 12.06, "end": 14.56}, {"text": "We got a lot of drama and we got a lot of useful language.", "start": 14.8, "end": 17.8}, {"text": "Yeah, we're going to learn some phrases we can use to describe a mistake.", "start": 18.12, "end": 22.0}, {"text": "And we're also going to learn how we can comfort someone. We can make them feel better.", "start": 22.52, "end": 28.560000000000002}, {"text": "Okay, exactly. So in our dialogue today, Veronica and her boyfriend are on a break.", "start": 28.56, "end": 34.519999999999996}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 34.68, "end": 34.92}, {"text": "So what does it mean to be on a break?", "start": 35.22, "end": 36.839999999999996}, {"text": "Well, it means you stop having a romantic relationship for a short time.", "start": 37.239999999999995, "end": 41.86}, {"text": "So you can say we are on a break.", "start": 42.08, "end": 43.739999999999995}, {"text": "So we're not dating.", "start": 44.06, "end": 45.04}, {"text": "We're not dating.", "start": 45.16, "end": 45.76}, {"text": "But we don't date.", "start": 45.8, "end": 46.86}, {"text": "Or we could say let's take a break.", "start": 47.08, "end": 52.56}, {"text": "Right. So we've got the state on a break and the action. Take a break.", "start": 52.7, "end": 57.019999999999996}, {"text": "Take a break. Okay, let's take a break.", "start": 57.02, "end": 58.88}, {"text": "Okay, so let's listen to our dialogue.", "start": 59.06, "end": 60.720000000000006}, {"text": "And it's going to be a little bit fast.", "start": 60.92, "end": 62.5}, {"text": "And the girl, I think she's crying.", "start": 62.800000000000004, "end": 64.26}, {"text": "So it'll be a little bit difficult to understand.", "start": 64.42, "end": 66.22}, {"text": "But Marco and I will come back in a minute.", "start": 66.42, "end": 68.24000000000001}, {"text": "And we'll talk about some of the difficult language here.", "start": 68.32000000000001, "end": 70.30000000000001}, {"text": "So I said, let's take a break.", "start": 70.3, "end": 85.75999999999999}, {"text": "And since that night, I've been waiting for him to call, but I still haven't heard from him.", "start": 86.84, "end": 91.02}, {"text": "You don't think he's seeing someone else, do you?", "start": 91.02, "end": 94.78}, {"text": "Come on. Don't be so dramatic.", "start": 95.17999999999999, "end": 97.42}, {"text": "I'm sure everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 98.02, "end": 101.0}, {"text": "You think so?", "start": 101.47999999999999, "end": 102.47999999999999}, {"text": "Oh, no. How could he do this to me?", "start": 103.34, "end": 105.69999999999999}, {"text": "I'm sure he's cheating on me.", "start": 105.86, "end": 107.44}, {"text": "Why else wouldn't he call?", "start": 107.88, "end": 109.06}, {"text": "But you two are on a break.", "start": 109.84, "end": 111.52}, {"text": "Theoretically, he can do whatever he likes.", "start": 111.96, "end": 114.12}, {"text": "He's the love of my life.", "start": 114.12, "end": 116.5}, {"text": "I really messed this up.", "start": 118.92, "end": 121.02000000000001}, {"text": "Come on, hon. Pull yourself together.", "start": 121.38000000000001, "end": 123.66000000000001}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 123.96000000000001, "end": 125.30000000000001}, {"text": "But I...", "start": 131.20000000000002, "end": 132.26}, {"text": "I still love him.", "start": 132.26, "end": 135.26}, {"text": "And it's all my fault.", "start": 135.5, "end": 136.66}, {"text": "I can't believe how immature and salvaged I was being.", "start": 136.96, "end": 139.5}, {"text": "I mean...", "start": 139.84, "end": 140.9}, {"text": "He is a firefighter.", "start": 140.9, "end": 142.6}, {"text": "It's not like he can just leave someone in a burning building and meet me for dinner.", "start": 142.6, "end": 147.18}, {"text": "I've totally messed this up.", "start": 148.14, "end": 150.42}, {"text": "You know what, Veronica?", "start": 150.92, "end": 151.9}, {"text": "I think you should make the first step.", "start": 152.32, "end": 154.24}, {"text": "I'm sure he'll forgive you.", "start": 154.62, "end": 156.04}, {"text": "No.", "start": 156.42, "end": 156.82}, {"text": "This is not going to happen.", "start": 157.26, "end": 158.78}, {"text": "I...", "start": 158.92, "end": 159.28}, {"text": "I've ruined everything.", "start": 159.28, "end": 162.04}, {"text": "Hey, do you hear something?", "start": 164.0, "end": 165.68}, {"text": "Guess what?", "start": 165.68, "end": 172.20000000000002}, {"text": "It's your lovely firefighter.", "start": 172.3, "end": 173.86}, {"text": "Don't you know I sit around with my head hanging down?", "start": 173.86, "end": 181.56}, {"text": "No wonder.", "start": 181.56, "end": 182.8}, {"text": "Wow, that's a romantic boyfriend singing in the street.", "start": 202.1, "end": 205.02}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 205.52, "end": 206.3}, {"text": "That's amazing.", "start": 206.3, "end": 206.82}, {"text": "Have you ever done that for a girl?", "start": 206.94, "end": 208.6}, {"text": "Um...", "start": 208.6, "end": 209.6}, {"text": "No.", "start": 209.6, "end": 210.54}, {"text": "Well, have you ever sung to a girl at KTV?", "start": 212.0, "end": 214.4}, {"text": "I've sung to a girl on KTV.", "start": 214.74, "end": 216.14}, {"text": "And karaoke.", "start": 216.46, "end": 217.04}, {"text": "Karaoke, yeah.", "start": 217.51999999999998, "end": 218.26}, {"text": "So...", "start": 218.74, "end": 219.1}, {"text": "But not so much as an on the street with all the neighbors coming out to see me.", "start": 219.1, "end": 222.84}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 222.94, "end": 223.16}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 223.26, "end": 223.48}, {"text": "Well, I don't blame you.", "start": 223.54, "end": 224.46}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 225.07999999999998, "end": 225.62}, {"text": "Let's take a look at the language that we saw in our dialogue on Language Takeaway.", "start": 225.66, "end": 229.29999999999998}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 231.84, "end": 234.24}, {"text": "So, let's take a look at our first word.", "start": 234.24, "end": 236.06}, {"text": "Seeing someone.", "start": 236.64000000000001, "end": 237.56}, {"text": "Seeing someone.", "start": 237.74, "end": 238.5}, {"text": "Seeing someone.", "start": 239.20000000000002, "end": 240.18}, {"text": "Seeing someone.", "start": 240.38, "end": 240.94}, {"text": "So, if I'm seeing someone...", "start": 241.60000000000002, "end": 243.22}, {"text": "You're dating them.", "start": 243.22, "end": 244.06}, {"text": "I'm dating them.", "start": 244.24, "end": 245.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 245.14000000000001, "end": 245.36}, {"text": "I'm frequently going out with that person.", "start": 245.54000000000002, "end": 247.44}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 247.66, "end": 248.0}, {"text": "So...", "start": 248.66, "end": 249.18}, {"text": "But it's not very serious.", "start": 249.18, "end": 250.44}, {"text": "No, it is serious.", "start": 251.04000000000002, "end": 252.56}, {"text": "But not really.", "start": 252.76000000000002, "end": 253.44}, {"text": "It's more of a casual thing.", "start": 253.48000000000002, "end": 254.86}, {"text": "It's not very exclusive.", "start": 254.92000000000002, "end": 256.04}, {"text": "So, if you are seeing someone, then you can also see another person.", "start": 256.54, "end": 260.78000000000003}, {"text": "Maybe.", "start": 261.22, "end": 261.7}, {"text": "Hmm.", "start": 262.32, "end": 262.7}, {"text": "Hmm.", "start": 262.7, "end": 262.8}, {"text": "Well, I think sometimes seeing someone can mean actually they're your boyfriend or girlfriend.", "start": 263.34, "end": 267.96}, {"text": "Like, I'm seeing John.", "start": 268.9, "end": 270.02}, {"text": "He's my boyfriend.", "start": 270.14, "end": 270.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 271.26, "end": 271.64}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 271.92, "end": 272.14}, {"text": "See, this is the difficult thing about seeing someone is that for some people, it means it's", "start": 272.2, "end": 276.08}, {"text": "really serious.", "start": 276.08, "end": 276.9}, {"text": "While for other people, it means it's more casual.", "start": 277.06, "end": 279.2}, {"text": "I guess it's important that you and your boyfriend or girlfriend share the same view", "start": 279.44, "end": 283.82}, {"text": "on the meaning of this word.", "start": 283.82, "end": 284.94}, {"text": "Have to agree on what seeing someone means.", "start": 285.03999999999996, "end": 287.71999999999997}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 287.8, "end": 288.03999999999996}, {"text": "Well, what's our next word, Marco?", "start": 288.14, "end": 289.14}, {"text": "Cheating on.", "start": 289.78, "end": 290.68}, {"text": "Cheating on someone.", "start": 291.03999999999996, "end": 292.3}, {"text": "Cheating on me.", "start": 292.3, "end": 293.88}, {"text": "Cheating on someone.", "start": 294.18, "end": 295.28000000000003}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 295.84000000000003, "end": 296.24}, {"text": "So, if you're cheating on someone.", "start": 296.44, "end": 298.90000000000003}, {"text": "Then you are like kissing or even having sex with someone who's not your boyfriend or", "start": 299.26, "end": 304.7}, {"text": "your husband or your girlfriend or your wife.", "start": 304.7, "end": 306.22}, {"text": "So, if I say she cheated on me, that means that my girlfriend kissed or had sex with another", "start": 306.72, "end": 314.5}, {"text": "guy.", "start": 314.5, "end": 314.82}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 315.0, "end": 315.26}, {"text": "But if I say she cheated me.", "start": 315.26, "end": 317.92}, {"text": "Yeah, that's different.", "start": 318.44, "end": 319.14}, {"text": "That's different, right?", "start": 319.21999999999997, "end": 319.9}, {"text": "It's different.", "start": 319.9, "end": 320.28}, {"text": "Maybe she sold you something for a really high price.", "start": 320.48, "end": 323.15999999999997}, {"text": "She cheated me.", "start": 323.38, "end": 324.3}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 324.38, "end": 324.65999999999997}, {"text": "Or maybe she sold me something that was fake.", "start": 324.8, "end": 327.56}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 327.88, "end": 328.18}, {"text": "Or broken or something.", "start": 328.24, "end": 329.15999999999997}, {"text": "Or broken.", "start": 329.15999999999997, "end": 329.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 329.58, "end": 329.68}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 329.74, "end": 329.88}, {"text": "So, cheated on is really different from cheated.", "start": 329.98, "end": 332.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 332.82, "end": 333.26}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our next word.", "start": 333.4, "end": 334.8}, {"text": "Messed this up.", "start": 335.46, "end": 336.42}, {"text": "Messed this up.", "start": 336.82, "end": 337.94}, {"text": "Messed this up.", "start": 338.62, "end": 339.84}, {"text": "Messed this up.", "start": 340.0, "end": 340.92}, {"text": "So, Marco, this is a phrasal verb and that means we can sort of switch it around a little", "start": 340.92, "end": 346.04}, {"text": "bit, right?", "start": 346.04, "end": 346.46000000000004}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 346.76, "end": 347.2}, {"text": "Why don't we listen to some examples and then we can come back and talk some more.", "start": 347.48, "end": 351.1}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 352.2, "end": 353.02000000000004}, {"text": "I messed up on the exam and now I won't pass my class.", "start": 354.88, "end": 358.26}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 361.22, "end": 362.0}, {"text": "When I'm cooking, I always mess up and burn the rice.", "start": 364.26, "end": 367.26}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 367.26, "end": 367.62}, {"text": "So, messed up.", "start": 369.8, "end": 370.38}, {"text": "It's pretty clear, I think.", "start": 370.42, "end": 371.32}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 371.42, "end": 371.58}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 371.9, "end": 372.28}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our next word.", "start": 372.32, "end": 373.53999999999996}, {"text": "Immature.", "start": 374.3, "end": 374.65999999999997}, {"text": "Immature.", "start": 375.18, "end": 375.53999999999996}, {"text": "Immature.", "start": 376.32, "end": 376.71999999999997}, {"text": "Immature.", "start": 376.94, "end": 377.26}, {"text": "So, when someone is immature.", "start": 377.92, "end": 379.38}, {"text": "They're acting really young.", "start": 379.64, "end": 380.8}, {"text": "Really young, right?", "start": 380.98, "end": 381.68}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 381.68, "end": 381.86}, {"text": "But it's not a very good thing to be immature.", "start": 382.02, "end": 383.98}, {"text": "No.", "start": 384.18, "end": 384.48}, {"text": "It has a negative meaning.", "start": 384.58, "end": 386.36}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 386.68, "end": 387.03999999999996}, {"text": "It's normal for children to be immature.", "start": 387.36, "end": 389.34}, {"text": "Because they're children.", "start": 389.78, "end": 390.34}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 390.48, "end": 390.74}, {"text": "But not an adult.", "start": 391.02, "end": 391.9}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 392.09999999999997, "end": 392.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 392.5, "end": 392.88}, {"text": "So, we've got some examples that will help you to understand this word a little bit better.", "start": 392.88, "end": 397.12}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 397.56, "end": 398.52}, {"text": "Your toilet jokes are not funny.", "start": 400.62, "end": 402.52}, {"text": "Stop being so immature.", "start": 402.88, "end": 404.09999999999997}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 406.53999999999996, "end": 407.46}, {"text": "Jeannie acts like she's 16.", "start": 409.38, "end": 411.21999999999997}, {"text": "She's so immature.", "start": 411.42, "end": 412.38}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 415.5, "end": 416.46}, {"text": "God.", "start": 418.03999999999996, "end": 418.59999999999997}, {"text": "You and your friends always act so immature.", "start": 418.71999999999997, "end": 420.88}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 420.88, "end": 423.4}, {"text": "So, immature.", "start": 423.52, "end": 424.26}, {"text": "Now, let's take a look at our next word.", "start": 424.92, "end": 426.64}, {"text": "Selfish.", "start": 427.04, "end": 427.44}, {"text": "Selfish.", "start": 427.84, "end": 428.2}, {"text": "Selfish.", "start": 429.15999999999997, "end": 429.52}, {"text": "Selfish.", "start": 430.06, "end": 430.42}, {"text": "So, a selfish person.", "start": 430.76, "end": 432.26}, {"text": "Is a person who only thinks about themselves.", "start": 433.02000000000004, "end": 435.84000000000003}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 436.14000000000004, "end": 436.38}, {"text": "So, I only think about me.", "start": 436.42, "end": 437.68}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 437.94, "end": 438.16}, {"text": "No one else.", "start": 438.24, "end": 438.94}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 439.14000000000004, "end": 439.3}, {"text": "You don't care about other people's feelings.", "start": 439.32, "end": 440.90000000000003}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 441.14000000000004, "end": 441.52000000000004}, {"text": "So, it's not a good thing to be immature or selfish.", "start": 441.96000000000004, "end": 444.84000000000003}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 445.1, "end": 445.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 445.8, "end": 446.04}, {"text": "So, I think it's time for us to listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 446.08000000000004, "end": 448.40000000000003}, {"text": "We're going to slow it down a little bit.", "start": 448.6, "end": 450.16}, {"text": "And this will help you to understand these phrases a little bit more clearly.", "start": 450.26, "end": 453.48}, {"text": "So, I said, let's take a break.", "start": 453.48, "end": 462.22}, {"text": "And since that night, I've been waiting for him to call.", "start": 463.06, "end": 466.86}, {"text": "But I still haven't heard from him.", "start": 467.5, "end": 469.5}, {"text": "You don't think he's seeing someone else, do you?", "start": 470.20000000000005, "end": 473.28000000000003}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 473.86, "end": 474.82}, {"text": "Don't be so dramatic.", "start": 475.3, "end": 476.96000000000004}, {"text": "I'm sure everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 477.66, "end": 481.20000000000005}, {"text": "You think so?", "start": 481.84000000000003, "end": 482.8}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 482.8, "end": 484.62}, {"text": "How can he do this to me?", "start": 485.36, "end": 487.90000000000003}, {"text": "I'm sure he's cheating on me.", "start": 488.54, "end": 491.14}, {"text": "Why else wouldn't he call?", "start": 491.74, "end": 493.68}, {"text": "But you two are on a break, theoretically.", "start": 494.56, "end": 498.0}, {"text": "He can do whatever he likes.", "start": 499.14, "end": 501.28000000000003}, {"text": "He's the love of my life.", "start": 501.90000000000003, "end": 504.28000000000003}, {"text": "I've really messed this up.", "start": 504.98, "end": 507.7}, {"text": "Come on, hon.", "start": 508.48, "end": 510.1}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 510.66, "end": 512.24}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 512.8, "end": 514.62}, {"text": "But I...", "start": 514.62, "end": 515.62}, {"text": "I still love him.", "start": 515.62, "end": 518.26}, {"text": "And it's all my fault.", "start": 518.8, "end": 520.4599999999999}, {"text": "I can't believe how immature and selfish I was being.", "start": 521.3599999999999, "end": 526.2199999999999}, {"text": "I mean, he is a firefighter.", "start": 526.22, "end": 530.1}, {"text": "It's not like he can just leave someone in a burning building and meet me for dinner.", "start": 530.1, "end": 537.46}, {"text": "I've totally messed this up.", "start": 538.0400000000001, "end": 540.72}, {"text": "You know what, Veronica?", "start": 540.72, "end": 542.5400000000001}, {"text": "I think you should make the first step.", "start": 542.5400000000001, "end": 546.46}, {"text": "I'm sure he'll forgive you.", "start": 546.88, "end": 548.88}, {"text": "No.", "start": 549.38, "end": 550.0600000000001}, {"text": "This is not going to happen.", "start": 550.5400000000001, "end": 552.4200000000001}, {"text": "I...", "start": 553.1800000000001, "end": 553.74}, {"text": "I've ruined everything.", "start": 553.74, "end": 556.12}, {"text": "Hey, do you hear something?", "start": 556.12, "end": 559.34}, {"text": "Guess what?", "start": 559.94, "end": 561.04}, {"text": "It's your lovely firefighter.", "start": 561.58, "end": 563.78}, {"text": "Okay, so we saw Veronica's friend trying to calm her down.", "start": 563.78, "end": 577.6}, {"text": "Yeah, trying to comfort her.", "start": 577.6, "end": 579.16}, {"text": "Okay, to make her feel better.", "start": 579.22, "end": 580.54}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 580.68, "end": 580.8199999999999}, {"text": "Let's take a look at some of the phrases she used in Fluency Builder.", "start": 580.82, "end": 584.58}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 585.86, "end": 586.86}, {"text": "Okay, so what was the first phrase that she said?", "start": 587.6600000000001, "end": 590.32}, {"text": "Everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 590.6400000000001, "end": 592.86}, {"text": "Everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 593.12, "end": 595.6800000000001}, {"text": "Everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 595.82, "end": 597.86}, {"text": "What does that mean?", "start": 598.08, "end": 598.86}, {"text": "It's going to be okay.", "start": 599.12, "end": 600.0600000000001}, {"text": "It's going to be okay, right?", "start": 600.2, "end": 601.12}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 601.2, "end": 601.36}, {"text": "The problem will be solved.", "start": 601.4200000000001, "end": 602.94}, {"text": "Okay, so if somebody is worried or somebody is crying, you can say,", "start": 602.94, "end": 607.4200000000001}, {"text": "don't worry, everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 607.5, "end": 610.7600000000001}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 610.8800000000001, "end": 611.08}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 611.6800000000001, "end": 612.1600000000001}, {"text": "Okay, let's look at the next one.", "start": 612.3800000000001, "end": 613.9200000000001}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 614.5600000000001, "end": 615.5200000000001}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 615.84, "end": 616.94}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 617.3000000000001, "end": 618.7}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 618.86, "end": 619.7}, {"text": "So what does that mean exactly?", "start": 620.2800000000001, "end": 621.36}, {"text": "It sounds kind of weird.", "start": 621.4200000000001, "end": 622.2800000000001}, {"text": "I know.", "start": 622.4000000000001, "end": 622.6800000000001}, {"text": "I guess it just means stop crying, relax, and, you know, take a deep breath.", "start": 622.7600000000001, "end": 627.6800000000001}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 627.8800000000001, "end": 628.2800000000001}, {"text": "Just like calm down.", "start": 628.5600000000001, "end": 629.96}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 630.0200000000001, "end": 630.72}, {"text": "Get organized.", "start": 630.72, "end": 631.2600000000001}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah.", "start": 631.2600000000001, "end": 631.96}, {"text": "Your ideas and your thoughts.", "start": 631.96, "end": 633.32}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 633.48, "end": 633.64}, {"text": "So you can think of maybe somebody who's got tears down their face and everything is sort", "start": 633.76, "end": 638.76}, {"text": "of in a mess.", "start": 638.76, "end": 639.6}, {"text": "If you pull it together, they clean up and they sort of relax, right?", "start": 639.7800000000001, "end": 643.6}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 643.6600000000001, "end": 644.0}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 644.6, "end": 645.5600000000001}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 645.6600000000001, "end": 645.94}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 646.6, "end": 646.96}, {"text": "And the last phrase that we saw, it's going to be all right.", "start": 647.0400000000001, "end": 650.84}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 651.0600000000001, "end": 652.36}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 652.5400000000001, "end": 654.2800000000001}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 654.38, "end": 655.34}, {"text": "So it's going to be all right means everything is going to be okay.", "start": 655.5600000000001, "end": 660.0400000000001}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 660.04, "end": 660.48}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 660.78, "end": 661.0999999999999}, {"text": "It's going to be fine.", "start": 661.14, "end": 662.16}, {"text": "It's going to be fine.", "start": 662.28, "end": 663.0799999999999}, {"text": "The problem will go away.", "start": 663.16, "end": 664.24}, {"text": "You'll feel better.", "start": 664.76, "end": 665.62}, {"text": "Maybe you could even say, it'll be all right.", "start": 665.8, "end": 667.9599999999999}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 668.0999999999999, "end": 668.36}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 668.5999999999999, "end": 668.76}, {"text": "It'll be all right.", "start": 668.8399999999999, "end": 669.7199999999999}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 669.8199999999999, "end": 669.9399999999999}, {"text": "These are three really helpful phrases that you can use when you want to say something", "start": 670.26, "end": 674.8}, {"text": "nice to a friend or a colleague who has a problem.", "start": 674.8, "end": 678.1999999999999}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 678.42, "end": 678.78}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 679.24, "end": 679.62}, {"text": "Very useful language.", "start": 679.7199999999999, "end": 680.52}, {"text": "So let's listen to some more examples.", "start": 680.52, "end": 682.52}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 683.52, "end": 684.4399999999999}, {"text": "Don't worry.", "start": 686.92, "end": 687.54}, {"text": "Everything's going to work out just fine.", "start": 687.62, "end": 689.06}, {"text": "I'm sure he still loves you.", "start": 689.42, "end": 690.6}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 695.74, "end": 696.54}, {"text": "Everything's going to be all right.", "start": 700.64, "end": 701.9399999999999}, {"text": "We'll find your puppy.", "start": 702.26, "end": 703.18}, {"text": "Don't worry.", "start": 703.36, "end": 704.06}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 704.06, "end": 704.5}, {"text": "Great examples.", "start": 707.42, "end": 708.1199999999999}, {"text": "And I think it's clear now.", "start": 708.2399999999999, "end": 709.2399999999999}, {"text": "So let's listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 709.6199999999999, "end": 711.7399999999999}, {"text": "And then we'll come back and talk some more.", "start": 712.0, "end": 713.4799999999999}, {"text": "So, so I said, let's take a break.", "start": 719.5799999999999, "end": 722.26}, {"text": "And since that night, I've been waiting for him to call, but I still haven't heard from", "start": 723.3599999999999, "end": 727.3}, {"text": "him.", "start": 727.3, "end": 727.52}, {"text": "You don't think he's seeing someone else, do you?", "start": 727.52, "end": 731.28}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 731.66, "end": 732.42}, {"text": "Don't be so dramatic.", "start": 732.54, "end": 733.9}, {"text": "I'm sure everything is going to work out just fine.", "start": 734.52, "end": 737.48}, {"text": "You think so?", "start": 737.98, "end": 738.96}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 739.8, "end": 740.4}, {"text": "How could he do this to me?", "start": 740.72, "end": 742.18}, {"text": "I'm sure he's cheating on me.", "start": 742.34, "end": 743.92}, {"text": "Why else wouldn't he call?", "start": 744.34, "end": 745.56}, {"text": "But you two are on a break.", "start": 746.34, "end": 748.0}, {"text": "Theoretically, he can do whatever he likes.", "start": 748.4399999999999, "end": 750.64}, {"text": "He's the love of my life.", "start": 751.3199999999999, "end": 752.96}, {"text": "I've really messed this up.", "start": 755.48, "end": 757.48}, {"text": "Come on, hon.", "start": 757.78, "end": 758.88}, {"text": "Pull yourself together.", "start": 759.02, "end": 760.14}, {"text": "It's going to be all right.", "start": 760.4399999999999, "end": 761.9399999999999}, {"text": "But I, I still love him.", "start": 767.72, "end": 771.74}, {"text": "And it's all my fault.", "start": 771.98, "end": 773.14}, {"text": "I can't believe how immature and selfish I was being.", "start": 773.4399999999999, "end": 775.98}, {"text": "I mean, he is a firefighter.", "start": 776.3199999999999, "end": 779.0799999999999}, {"text": "It's not like he can just leave someone in a burning building and meet me for dinner.", "start": 779.4399999999999, "end": 783.66}, {"text": "I've totally messed this up.", "start": 784.78, "end": 786.9}, {"text": "You know what, Veronica?", "start": 786.9, "end": 788.38}, {"text": "I think you should make the first step.", "start": 788.78, "end": 790.72}, {"text": "I'm sure he'll forgive you.", "start": 791.22, "end": 792.52}, {"text": "No.", "start": 792.9, "end": 793.26}, {"text": "This is not going to happen.", "start": 793.86, "end": 795.24}, {"text": "I, I ruined everything.", "start": 795.38, "end": 798.52}, {"text": "Hey, do you hear something?", "start": 800.6, "end": 802.24}, {"text": "Guess what?", "start": 802.24, "end": 808.6800000000001}, {"text": "It's your lovely firefighter.", "start": 808.76, "end": 810.38}, {"text": "Don't you know I sit around with my head hanging down?", "start": 810.38, "end": 818.04}, {"text": "No wonder.", "start": 818.5, "end": 819.3}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 824.4399999999999, "end": 824.92}, {"text": "Okay, I really like this dialogue.", "start": 824.92, "end": 837.18}, {"text": "It's so romantic.", "start": 837.28, "end": 837.9599999999999}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 838.24, "end": 838.4399999999999}, {"text": "It's drama, but at the same time romantic.", "start": 838.54, "end": 840.4}, {"text": "So we want to know what you think will happen next.", "start": 841.12, "end": 843.78}, {"text": "Yeah, will they get back together?", "start": 843.9799999999999, "end": 845.74}, {"text": "Will they get married?", "start": 845.74, "end": 846.92}, {"text": "Will they have a baby?", "start": 847.18, "end": 847.92}, {"text": "Maybe they'll break up forever.", "start": 848.4, "end": 849.4599999999999}, {"text": "Maybe she'll move halfway across the world.", "start": 850.16, "end": 852.4399999999999}, {"text": "Anything can happen.", "start": 853.24, "end": 854.22}, {"text": "So let us know what you think will happen.", "start": 854.3000000000001, "end": 856.46}, {"text": "Come to our website at englishpod.com and leave your comments on the lesson page.", "start": 856.84, "end": 861.48}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 861.7800000000001, "end": 862.2}, {"text": "And maybe you'll be right.", "start": 862.36, "end": 863.3800000000001}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 863.5200000000001, "end": 863.7}, {"text": "You never know.", "start": 863.9200000000001, "end": 864.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 864.72, "end": 865.1600000000001}, {"text": "So we're out of time for today.", "start": 865.58, "end": 866.7800000000001}, {"text": "I hope you guys had fun and we'll see you next time.", "start": 866.86, "end": 869.1400000000001}, {"text": "Until then, it's...", "start": 869.3800000000001, "end": 870.1600000000001}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 870.1600000000001, "end": 870.34}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 870.34, "end": 870.7600000000001}]